<div class="ch-admin"><p>Manage independent chess content and inspect the connected backend. Historical content revisions and completed games remain preserved.</p><p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="<?php echo htmlspecialchars(Uri::root().'index.php?option=com_chesselo5000',ENT_QUOTES);?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open chess laboratory</a> <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="ch-refresh">Refresh status</button></p><div id="ch-status" role="status">Connecting to chess backend…</div><div class="ch-admin-grid">
